> James Kanze

If strength loss would put you below 3, it adds points until your
strength is equal to 3, but for each point of strength it adds,
it subtracts 6 HP and 6 MaxHP.  So even though you don't reach
0 strength, you can still die from strength drain.  If you're
polymorphed, it subtracts from monster hit points instead of
your normal hit points, but it acts on base strength, so
gauntlets of power won't help.
(q.v. losestr() in attrib.c)


